WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:04,120
You should have Turtle Ultimate and Turtle Advanced, right?

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,520
Ultimate 1.1 million

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,720
Premium 2.1 million

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,920
There are also super ones

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,320
The price is 5.2 million

6
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,320
I want them all

7
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,120
It would take an ordinary person more than half a year to cover and polish the skills layer by layer.

8
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,920
But my god-level pre-sale space only takes a few dozen days

9
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,520
Spend millions in exchange for the opportunity to hit the perfect level with your skills

10
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,720
Once all skills are resold and reached perfection

11
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:21,920
Invincible within the same level

12
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,920
Not empty talk

13
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:28,250
The original price of three skill scrolls is 8.4 million.

14
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:31,050
After discount, the actual price will be 7.18 million.

15
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:36,170
More than 14 million are gone in a blink of an eye

16
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:38,430
There are only 3.68 million left in the card

17
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:51,620
I couldn't have shrunk so quickly even if I had spent my money on fire.

18
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:54,150
Are you planning to break up with me?

19
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:55,350
You are such a good girlfriend

20
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:57,210
How could I be willing to break up with you?

21
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:59,010
But we agreed at the beginning

22
00:00:59,010 --> 00:01:01,240
The borrowed money must be repaid with interest.

23
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:05,190
You can't make me keep my words, right?

24
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:08,850
But the interest of 500,000 is too much, right?

25
00:01:08,850 --> 00:01:11,680
I'm not a loan shark

26
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,680
Without the 3 million you lent me

27
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,640
There would be no shrinking like now

28
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,240
So this 500,000 is really not much
